    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia**_\n\nBefore: on the Mac, every fish start printed `source: Error encountered while sourcing file '~/.local/bin/env.fish'`, because `conf.d/typlite.env.fish` sources it unconditionally and typlite's installer never ran there (`~/.local/bin` only holds `claude`).\n\nAfter: the file is sourced only if it exists, so the error is gone on machines without typlite and nothing changes where it is installed.\n\nHow: `test -f ...; and source ...`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
